// The field repair kit (crafting.md, 4.6): consumed to mend a weapon and its
// fitted parts. Its one line says how much it restores; at a workbench any
// kit restores everything, so the line matters in the field and the poorest
// kit is the one a bench spends. Bought at store grade, or made from the
// light alloy and a seal set
// (`assets/schematics/field_repair_kit.schematic.ron`).
(
    id: "veyra:kit.field_repair",
    name: "Field repair kit",
    maker: "the dealer",
    kind: Kit,
    stack: 10,
    lines: [
        (id: "restore", name: "Restoration"),
    ],
    icon: (shape: Slab, color: "#D9A441", symbol: Some("veyra:icon.ability.field-repair")),
)
